name: "cryogenic-frontiers"
displayName: "[#6ecdec]Cryogenic Frontiers[]"
author: "sonip362"
description: '''
A complete standalone cryogenic technology ecosystem and expansion for Mindustry.
100% self-contained: features zero dependencies on vanilla resources, ammo, or crafting trees.

Features:
- Natural Ores: Glacite (dense structural metal), Cryo-Shale (ballistic mineral), Boreonite (volatile fuel), Polar Quartz (glacial silica)
- Intermediate Refineries: Cryo-Synthesizer (Subzero Silicon), Cryo-Glass Kiln (Cryo-Glass), Cryo-Freezer (Chilled Water)
- Advanced Materials: Cryo-Crystal, Cryo-Alloy (superconducting composite)
- Expanded Fortifications: Glacite Walls (T1), Cryo Walls (T2 reactive freeze nova), Shielded Cryo Walls (T3 deflecting superconducting armor)
- Logistics Suite: Cryo Conveyors, Routers, Distributors, Junctions, Bridges & Cryo Conduits, Liquid Routers, Tanks, Liquid Junctions, Liquid Bridges
- Heavy Turrets: Frostbite, Permafrost, Absolute Zero, Glacialis Railgun, Blizzard Rotary Cannon, Avalanche Torpedo Launcher
- Power: Thermo-Stirling Engine (Boreonite fuel), Zero-Point Cryo-Reactor
- Units & Command: Cryo Unit Factory, Boreas interceptor, Core: Frost with Frost Alpha mining builder unit
- Next-Gen Remaster: All sprites upgraded with modern v7 directional lighting, chamfered armor plates, and emissive cores.
'''
version: "2.0.0"
minGameVersion: "136"
hidden: false
